---
// Saleha AI - 100/100 Lighthouse Astro 5 Landing Page with 3D WebGL & Multi-Theme Engine
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Saleha AI — Sovereign Autonomous AI Software Engineer ($0/mo Local)</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Local-first autonomous multi-agent coding platform powered by Ollama. 1,004+ AgentSkills, 18 Specialized Python Agents, Universal MCP Hub, and sub-100μs deterministic AST verification.">
  
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fira+Code:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  
  <!-- Three.js for 3D Neural Swarm Canvas -->
  <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js"></script>

  <style>
    :root {
      --bg-base: #06080d;
      --bg-surface: #0c101a;
      --bg-elevated: #131929;
      --bg-hover: #1b233a;
      --accent: #38bdf8;
      --accent-glow: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.35);
      --accent-purple: #818cf8;
      --accent-green: #10b981;
      --text-bright: #f8fafc;
      --text-main: #cbd5e1;
      --text-dim: #64748b;
      --border-subtle: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      --border-bright: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.4);
      --font-sans: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
      --font-heading: 'Space Grotesk', var(--font-sans);
      --font-mono: 'Fira Code', monospace;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; color-scheme: dark; }

    body {
      background-color: var(--bg-base);
      color: var(--text-main);
      font-family: var(--font-sans);
      min-height: 100vh;
      overflow-x: hidden;
      line-height: 1.6;
      transition: background-color 0.3s ease, color 0.3s ease;
    }

    /* 3D WebGL Canvas Background */
    #hero-canvas {
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 700px;
      z-index: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      opacity: 0.65;
    }

    /* Navigation Header */
    header {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 10;
    }

    .logo {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--text-bright);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
    }

    .logo-icon {
      width: 34px;
      height: 34px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent), var(--accent-purple));
      border-radius: 8px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      box-shadow: 0 0 16px var(--accent-glow);
    }

    nav {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 1.5rem;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    nav a {
      color: var(--text-dim);
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: color 0.15s ease;
    }

    nav a:hover { color: var(--text-bright); }

    /* Theme Switcher Button */
    .theme-select {
      background: var(--bg-elevated);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      color: var(--text-bright);
      padding: 0.35rem 0.75rem;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      outline: none;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    /* Hero Section */
    .hero {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
      max-width: 950px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 4rem 1.5rem 3rem;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }

    .badge {
      background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.12);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-bright);
      color: var(--accent);
      padding: 0.4rem 1.2rem;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.15);
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem);
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--text-bright);
      line-height: 1.12;
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
    }

    .gradient-text {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent), var(--accent-purple));
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    }

    p.subtitle {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      color: var(--text-dim);
      max-width: 720px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .cta-group {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 1rem;
      margin-top: 0.5rem;
    }

    .btn-primary {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent), var(--accent-purple));
      color: #000;
      padding: 0.85rem 1.75rem;
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-decoration: none;
      box-shadow: 0 0 30px var(--accent-glow);
      transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }

    .btn-primary:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 0 45px var(--accent-glow);
    }

    .btn-secondary {
      background: var(--bg-elevated);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      color: var(--text-bright);
      padding: 0.85rem 1.75rem;
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: background 0.15s ease;
    }

    .btn-secondary:hover { background: var(--bg-hover); }

    /* Interactive Live Swarm Terminal */
    .terminal-container {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 1000px;
      margin: 3rem auto 0;
      background: var(--bg-surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-bright);
      border-radius: 16px;
      box-shadow: 0 25px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.5), 0 0 30px rgba(56,189,248,0.1);
      overflow: hidden;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .terminal-header {
      background: var(--bg-elevated);
      padding: 0.75rem 1.25rem;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    }

    .terminal-dots { display: flex; gap: 6px; }
    .dot { width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; }
    .dot-red { background: #ef4444; }
    .dot-yellow { background: #f59e0b; }
    .dot-green { background: #10b981; }

    .terminal-body {
      padding: 1.5rem;
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      background: #030712;
      min-height: 220px;
      color: var(--text-bright);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    /* Grid Features */
    .features-section {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 5rem auto;
      padding: 0 1.5rem;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 2.5rem;
    }

    .section-title {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 2.2rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--text-bright);
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
    }

    .grid-3 {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }

    .card {
      background: var(--bg-surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 2rem;
      transition: transform 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1), border-color 0.25s;
    }

    .card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      border-color: var(--border-bright);
      box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
    }

    .card-icon {
      font-size: 2rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      width: 48px;
      height: 48px;
      background: var(--bg-elevated);
      border-radius: 12px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    }

    .card h3 {
      color: var(--text-bright);
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .card p {
      color: var(--text-dim);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    /* Benchmark Matrix */
    .benchmark-table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      background: var(--bg-surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      border-radius: 14px;
      overflow: hidden;
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
    }

    .benchmark-table th, .benchmark-table td {
      padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
      text-align: left;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    .benchmark-table th {
      background: var(--bg-elevated);
      color: var(--text-bright);
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .highlight-cell {
      color: var(--accent);
      font-weight: 700;
      background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.08);
    }

    /* Footer */
    footer {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      padding: 3rem 1.5rem;
      text-align: center;
      color: var(--text-dim);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      margin-top: 5rem;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <!-- 3D Background Neural Canvas -->
  <canvas id="hero-canvas"></canvas>

  <header>
    <a href="#" class="logo">
      <div class="logo-icon">🧠</div>
      <span>Saleha AI</span>
    </a>
    <nav>
      <a href="#features">Features</a>
      <a href="#agents">18 Agents</a>
      <a href="#benchmarks">Benchmarks</a>
      <select id="themeSelector" class="theme-select" aria-label="Select Theme">
        <option value="obsidian">🌌 Obsidian Dark</option>
        <option value="oled">🖤 Midnight OLED</option>
        <option value="cyber">⚡ Cyberpunk</option>
        <option value="aurora">🌿 Aurora Emerald</option>
        <option value="matrix">🧬 Neon Matrix</option>
        <option value="hyperlight">☀️ Hyper Light</option>
      </select>
      <a href="http://127.0.0.1:8000" class="btn-primary" style="padding: 0.45rem 1rem; font-size: 0.85rem;">Launch Studio →</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main class="hero">
    <div class="badge">
      <span>🚀</span> Saleha v2.6.0 Enterprise Local Suite
    </div>
    <h1>The Sovereign <span class="gradient-text">Autonomous AI</span> Software Engineer</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">
      Zero cloud token leaks. 100% private. 18 Specialized Python Agents collaborating via Tree-of-Thoughts exploration and sub-100μs deterministic AST sandboxed verification.
    </p>

    <div class="cta-group">
      <a href="http://127.0.0.1:8000" class="btn-primary">⚡ Launch Web Studio 2.6</a>
      <a href="#benchmarks" class="btn-secondary">📊 View SWE Benchmarks</a>
    </div>

    <!-- Live Interactive Swarm Terminal Simulator -->
    <div class="terminal-container">
      <div class="terminal-header">
        <div class="terminal-dots">
          <div class="dot dot-red"></div>
          <div class="dot dot-yellow"></div>
          <div class="dot dot-green"></div>
        </div>
        <span style="font-size:0.8rem; color:var(--text-dim); font-family:var(--font-mono);">saleha-swarm-orchestrator :: live_trace</span>
        <span style="font-size:0.75rem; color:var(--accent-green); font-weight:700;">● LOCAL OLLAMA CONNECTED</span>
      </div>
      <div class="terminal-body" id="terminalOutput">
        <p style="color:var(--text-dim);">[05:30:12] Initiating TreeOfThoughtsOrchestrator exploration (k=3, depth=4)...</p>
        <p style="color:var(--accent);">[05:30:13] 🏛️ ArchitectAgent: Synthesizing Hexagonal ADR for high-throughput ring buffer.</p>
        <p style="color:var(--text-bright);">[05:30:14] ⚡ CoderAgent: Synthesized zero-leak implementation in Rust/Python.</p>
        <p style="color:var(--accent-purple);">[05:30:14] 🛡️ SecurityGuardAgent: AST SAST Scan Complete — 0 CWE Vulnerabilities Detected.</p>
        <p style="color:var(--accent-green);">[05:30:15] 🧪 TesterAgent: Sandboxed verification executed: 14/14 PASSED in 38μs ($0 Token Cost).</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <section class="features-section" id="features">
    <h2 class="section-title">Engineered for Sovereign Zero-Leak Autonomy</h2>
    <div class="grid-3">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-icon">🛡️</div>
        <h3>AST SAST Security Guard</h3>
        <p>Polyglot AST scanning intercepts SQL injection, hardcoded tokens, and weak cryptography before any code reaches disk.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
