        <p>Architect, Developer, Designer, Security Guard, QA Lead, SRE, FinOps, DevOps, WebDev, and DataEngineer working in synchrony.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="features-section" id="benchmarks">
    <h2 class="section-title">SWE-Bench & Cost Comparison</h2>
    <table class="benchmark-table">
      <thead>
        <tr>
